odigy</strong> destined for the <strong>NBA</strong>, your dreams were shattered by an <strong>injury</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three years later</strong>, living with your gambling-addict father and bouncing between dead-end jobs is pushing you further into a suffocating situation with no way out in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your uncle gets you a job at a <strong>renowned music entertainment agency</strong>, giving you some room to breathe\u2014until a encounter with a <strong>pressured superstar</strong> threatens to turn your world upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be <strong>immersed</strong> in the <strong>city of Brookside</strong>, where you will discover the stories and characters that inhabit it\u2014<strong>for better or for worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567910/extras/597f5dd2e4ec40397893a72a9f4eddcf.avif?t=1770220927\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567910/extras_big/597f5dd2e4ec40397893a72a9f4eddcf.avif?t=1770220927 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Dreams: Redemption</strong> is a visual novel with mature themes, focusing on its story and the various branching paths you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The<strong> further you progress in the story</strong>, the more your choices will shape your story, and only you will decide the kind of relationships you'll build with <strong>the girls</strong> you meet, <strong>the enemies</strong> you'll confront, and <strong>the allies</strong> you'll rely on in <strong>Shattered Dreams: Redemption</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>these choices</strong> will likely become increasingly difficult to make, as they <strong>won't</strong> <strong>only affect you but also those around you</strong>. The\u00a0<s